against `../openapi/frontend-api.yaml`. See `../AGENT-DESIGN.md` for the full pipeline, the eval results
(including the one mutation it did *not* catch and why), and what a human still needs to decide before this
gets promoted into `../../automation/`.

Run the eval yourself: `cd agentic && npm install && npm run eval`.

